bwPromptElectron:
Please use the agent-electron skill to operate this Electron tab:
- client_id: {{clientId}}
- accountIdx: {{accountIdx}}
- webContentsId: {{wc}}
- Title: {{title}}
- URL: {{url}}

Use these commands (with webContentsId={{wc}}):
  {{c}} tabs {{accountIdx}}            # list this profile's tabs
  {{c}} tab-nav {{wc}} <url>           # navigate
  {{c}} tab-eval {{wc}} '<js>'         # run JS to read data / operate
  {{c}} tab-screenshot {{wc}} --out shot.png
  {{c}} tab-activate {{wc}}   /   {{c}} tab-close {{wc}}

